          "_name": "article3",
          "_sourceTheme": "ascentm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"ascentm5 article3\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Items\" name=\"items\" min=\"1\" max=\"3\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\n\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center mb-5\">\n      <div class=\"col-12\">\n        <div class=\"line\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-6 col-title\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Pricing &amp; Service Information</b></h5>\n        <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n          Subtitle</h6>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-6\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-text1 mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">All pricing is as advertised per timeframe and per business location for single businesses who have claimed/verified Google Business Profiles and need assistance with optimization for improved lead generation. <b>Please reach out regarding pricing for multiple business locations.</b><br><br>This subscription service can be cancelled at anytime. If you need to return back to this service at a later date, you will need to begin again with any one-time service fees in addition to new quarterly or annual fees available at the time of purchase. <b>All pricing is subject to change without notice.</b><br></p>\n      </div>\n\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center mb-5\" mbr-if=\"items > 1\">\n      <div class=\"col-12\">\n        <div class=\"line\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-6 col-title \">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Payment Information</b></h5>\n        <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n          Subtitle</h6>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-6\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-text2 mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Proximity Billboards Markets uses third-party ecommerce platform, STRIPE for collection of service fees and cannot change anything pre-written within the software.<br><br>Once any service fees are collected <b>THERE ARE NO REFUNDS</b>, so plan carefully and accordingly and <b>ALWAYS ASK QUESTIONS IF YOU ARE NOT SURE OF SOMETHING.</b><br></p>\n      </div>\n\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center mb-5\" mbr-if=\"items > 2\">\n      <div class=\"col-12\">\n        <div class=\"line\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-6 col-title\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>About Us</b></h5>\n        <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n          Subtitle</h6>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-6\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-text3 mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>\n            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Suspendisse a lacus non elit pretium.\n            Proin pulvinar placerat&nbsp;tristique.</b></p>\n      </div>\n\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
